```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Alice
    participant NIP04Service
    participant KeyMgmt
    participant ECDH
    participant AES256
    participant NostrRelay

    Note over Alice,NostrRelay: Encrypted DM Encryption Flow

    Alice->>NIP04Service: encrypt(message, recipientPubkey)

    NIP04Service->>NIP04Service: Validate input parameters
    NIP04Service->>NIP04Service: Check spam protection

    NIP04Service->>KeyMgmt: getPrivateKey()
    KeyMgmt-->>NIP04Service: privateKey

    NIP04Service->>ECDH: deriveSharedSecret(privateKey, recipientPubkey)
    Note over ECDH: secp256k1 ECDH
    ECDH-->>NIP04Service: sharedSecret (32 bytes)

    NIP04Service->>NIP04Service: Generate random IV (16 bytes)
    Note over NIP04Service: crypto.getRandomValues()

    NIP04Service->>AES256: encrypt(plaintext, sharedSecret, IV)
    Note over AES256: AES-256-CBC
    AES256-->>NIP04Service: ciphertext

    NIP04Service->>NIP04Service: Base64 encode ciphertext and IV
    NIP04Service->>NIP04Service: Format: ciphertext?iv=base64_iv

    NIP04Service->>NIP04Service: createDMEvent(encrypted, recipientPubkey)
    NIP04Service->>KeyMgmt: signEvent(event)
    KeyMgmt-->>NIP04Service: signedEvent (kind 4)

    NIP04Service->>NIP04Service: maybeRotateSessionKey()
    Note over NIP04Service: Check if 100 messages sent

    NIP04Service-->>Alice: signedDMEvent

    Alice->>NostrRelay: publishEvent(signedDMEvent)
    NostrRelay-->>Alice: OK

    Note over Alice,NostrRelay: Total Security Steps: 10+
